§ `s 5, s 58A: my course and my provider`

-- k024: Jake's TAFE pre-apprenticeship course, accredited by the Council (HYPOTHETICAL). It is the School Education
-- Act s 11B(1)(b) option, not s 11B(1)(c) ("being an apprentice").
#ASSERT `Is my course an approved VET course` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my course an approved VET course` FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `May my provider offer me this course` `the TAFE college`
#ASSERT NOT `May my provider offer me this course` `an unregistered provider`
#ASSERT `May my provider offer me this course` `a monitored partner of a registered provider`

§ `ss 60C, 60D: which qualifications go through a training contract`

#ASSERT `May my employer put me on a training contract for it` `class A`
#ASSERT `May my employer put me on a training contract for it` `class B`
#ASSERT NOT `May my employer put me on a training contract for it` `class C`
#ASSERT NOT `May my employer put me on a training contract for it` `an approved VET qualification`

#ASSERT NOT `May my employer train me for it without a training contract` `class A`

#ASSERT `Can I get this qualification this way` `class A` `completing a registered training contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Can I get this qualification this way` `class A` `completing an approved VET course`
#ASSERT NOT `Can I get this qualification this way` `class A` `being assessed competent, without training from an employer`
#ASSERT NOT `Can I get this qualification this way` `class C` `completing a registered training contract`
#ASSERT `Can I get this qualification this way` `class B` `completing an approved VET course`

§ `ss 60A, 60B, 60E: what my training contract is`

-- k024: Jake at TAFE has no training contract and is not an apprentice under Part 7.
#ASSERT `Is my contract a training contract` `Liam's electrical apprenticeship contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my contract a training contract` `Jake's TAFE enrolment`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my contract a training contract` `a contract with two employers, not approved`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my contract a training contract` `a contract that leaves out paid training time`

#ASSERT `Am I an apprentice under Part 7` `Liam's electrical apprenticeship contract` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I an apprentice under Part 7` `Jake's TAFE enrolment` TRUE

-- Liam's day at TAFE is working time; Jake's (k030) is not, as he has no employer.
#ASSERT `Does my training time count as working time` `Liam's electrical apprenticeship contract` `away from the workplace, such as at TAFE`
#ASSERT NOT `Does my training time count as working time` `Jake's TAFE enrolment` `away from the workplace, such as at TAFE`

-- Liam at 17: whether he signs alone turns on the regulations (s 60(b), (c)), asked as facts.
#ASSERT NOT `Can I sign my training contract on my own` 17 TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I sign my training contract on my own` 17 TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I sign my training contract on my own` 19 FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `Which prevails, Part 7 or my award` TRUE EQUALS `Part 7 and its regulations prevail over the award`

§ `s 60F: registration`

#ASSERT NOT `Has my training contract started` FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `May my contract be refused registration` `lodged in order`
#ASSERT `May my contract be refused registration` `an employer the chief executive finds unfit`

#ASSERT `Who must lodge my training contract`  EQUALS `my employer`

§ `ss 60E(4), 60F(4): suspension, variation, transfer`

#ASSERT `Who may make this change` `a variation` EQUALS `my employer and I together`
#ASSERT `Who may make this change` `a transfer to another employer` EQUALS `my employer alone, to another person who employs me`

-- Liam's employer assigns his contract to a contractor who takes Liam on; then to one who does not employ him.
#ASSERT `May my contract be transferred to this employer` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `May my contract be transferred to this employer` TRUE FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `May I suspend my training contract` TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Must this change be lodged for registration` `a suspension`

§ `s 60G: probation and termination`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I protected from termination without my consent` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I protected from termination without my consent` FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated` `my employer` `in probation, without my consent`
#ASSERT NOT `May my contract be terminated` `my employer` `after probation, without consent or approval`
#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated` `my employer` `after probation, approved by the chief executive`
#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated` `me, the apprentice` `after probation, without consent or approval`
#ASSERT NOT `May my contract be terminated` `my employer` `no probation period, without my consent`

#ASSERT `Has my employer committed an offence by ending my contract` `after probation, without consent or approval`
#ASSERT NOT `Has my employer committed an offence by ending my contract` `in probation, without my consent`

#ASSERT `What must the chief executive do` `my employer has ceased or is about to cease business` EQUALS `must approve the termination, if satisfied the reason exists`
#ASSERT `What must the chief executive do` `some other reason` EQUALS `may refuse to approve the termination`

§ `ss 60F(5)-(6), 60H: when my contract ends`

#ASSERT `Is my training contract in effect` `registered and running`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my training contract in effect` `registration cancelled`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my training contract in effect` `not yet registered`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I still employed under my training contract` `registration cancelled`

#ASSERT `May we agree a new arrangement after it ends` 

#ASSERT NOT `May my contract's registration be cancelled` FALSE

