#ASSERT `May my provider confer this qualification` `class A` `the TAFE college` `Liam left halfway, assessed competent from his employer's training`
#ASSERT NOT `May my provider confer this qualification` `class A` `the TAFE college` `assessed competent, with no employer training`
#ASSERT NOT `May my provider confer this qualification` `class A` `the TAFE college` `Jake completed his Certificate II course`
