#ASSERT NOT `May my provider confer this qualification` `class C` `an unregistered provider` `Jake completed his Certificate II course`

§ `ss 60, 60F(8)-(9), 60G(4)-(5): appeals and disputes`

#ASSERT `May I appeal to the Commission` `the chief executive approving my employer's termination` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May I appeal to the Commission` `a training provider refusing me a qualification` FALSE
#ASSERT `May I appeal to the Commission` `a training provider refusing me a qualification` TRUE

#ASSERT `May the Commission do this on my appeal` `set it aside and order the chief executive to decide again`
#ASSERT NOT `May the Commission do this on my appeal` `award me compensation`

#ASSERT `Where can I take my dispute` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Act and its regulations set up no forum for it`
#ASSERT `Where can I take my dispute` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `to the chief executive or an appointee, then on appeal to the Industrial Relations Commission`

